836
01:22:36,911 --> 01:22:41,081
He was working Narcotics before that. Had some problems, divorced twice.
他之前在毒品科工作  離婚兩次

837
01:22:41,249 --> 01:22:44,251
Current wife's Justine. He's why the extra heat.
目前的太太叫彩鈿  是他鼓動嚴密監視的

838
01:22:46,546 --> 01:22:48,422
The Vice sergeant...
罪案科警官

839
01:22:49,466 --> 01:22:51,759
...says Hanna likes you.
說韓喜歡你

840
01:22:52,427 --> 01:22:55,846
Thinks you're some kind of star. You do this sharp, you do that sharp.
認為你是明星  行事很有技巧

841
01:22:56,014 --> 01:22:58,974
Look how sharp this guy is to figure that.
他能想到這樣看他有多聰明

842
01:23:00,852 --> 01:23:02,936
Funny as a heart attack, man. Three marriages.
他像心臟病般好笑  三次婚姻

843
01:23:03,104 --> 01:23:06,398
What the fuck do you think that means? He likes staying home?
你認為他喜歡待在家嗎

844
01:23:06,775 --> 01:23:09,276
Means the man is one of those guys out there...
他是那種

845
01:23:09,444 --> 01:23:12,363
...prowling around all night, dedicated.
整晚工作的人  很投入

846
01:23:14,616 --> 01:23:16,867
With this guy and this much heat, you should pass.
有他和警方監視  取消劫銀行吧

847
01:23:24,250 --> 01:23:25,626
It's worth the stretch.
值得冒險一試

848
01:23:26,836 --> 01:23:31,465
This guy can hit and miss. You can't miss once.
這人是否能抓住罪犯都無所謂  可你輸不起

849
01:23:31,800 --> 01:23:33,634
You sure?
你肯定嗎

850
01:23:34,052 --> 01:23:35,969
I'm sure.
肯定

851
01:23:41,309 --> 01:23:42,643
Let's go to the garage.
我們去車房吧

852
01:23:56,491 --> 01:23:58,158
Justine.
彩鈿

853
01:24:03,498 --> 01:24:05,457
Justine?
彩鈿

854
01:24:11,339 --> 01:24:13,132
Where we going?
我們要去哪兒

855
01:24:18,054 --> 01:24:21,223
- Okay, where are you going? - Out.
- 好吧  你要去哪兒  - 外面

856
01:25:19,574 --> 01:25:22,576
- What are you on? - TAC 9.
- 他們用什麼頻道  - 九號戰術頻道

857
01:25:23,997 --> 01:25:28,257
They're northbound out LAX on the 405. We got four ground units.
他們在四零五號公路  往機場方向北走

858
01:25:46,601 --> 01:25:49,311
This is Vincent Hanna in Air 18. Who have I got?
我是十八號機的韓·雲信  誰和我合作

859
01:25:49,646 --> 01:25:53,232
Hey, Vincent, it's JJ. I'm in Air 40. Richard Glover's with me.
我是四十號機的JJ  高·裏察和我在一起

860
01:25:53,399 --> 01:25:57,569
It's on the 105 eastbound approaching the 110 interchange.
車在一零五號公路  東行接近一一零號公路

861
01:25:58,238 --> 01:26:02,616
- You running a revolving tail? - Yeah, I got two units in front, three behind.
- 是交替追蹤嗎  - 是的  前面有兩輛車  三輛在他後面

862
01:26:02,784 --> 01:26:06,829
Okay, have one of them pick me up at the Vermont on-ramp.
要其中一輛在維蒙街接我

863
01:26:07,038 --> 01:26:08,413
Let's go.
走吧

864
01:26:58,423 --> 01:27:02,384
Am I 100 yards, or what? Am I close or far, or what?
我離他有一百碼嗎   太近還是太遠

865
01:27:02,552 --> 01:27:05,137
Three hundred yards, center lane.
離他三百碼  在中央行車線

866
01:28:11,746 --> 01:28:13,580
How you doing?
你好嗎

867
01:28:16,751 --> 01:28:19,795
What do you say I buy you a cup of coffee?
我請你喝咖啡如何

868
01:28:25,927 --> 01:28:29,221
- Yeah, sure. Let's go. - Follow me.
- 好的  走吧  - 跟著我

869
01:28:44,988 --> 01:28:47,447
Seven years in Folsom.
你在霍森監獄七年

870
01:28:47,615 --> 01:28:49,449
In the hole for three.
單獨囚禁三年

871
01:28:49,617 --> 01:28:50,909
McNeil before that.
之前在麥尼爾監獄

872
01:28:54,497 --> 01:28:56,832
McNeil as tough as they say?
那兒是一如所說的那麼兇殘嗎

873
01:28:57,709 --> 01:28:59,584
You looking to become a penologist?
你想成為監獄學者嗎

874
01:29:00,800 --> 01:29:02,200
You're looking to go back?
你想再坐牢嗎

875
01:29:02,300 --> 01:29:05,600
You know, I chase down some crews guys just looking to fuck up,
我追捕過不少把事情搞砸  只能束手被擒的人

876
01:29:05,700 --> 01:29:08,552
get busted back. That you?
再次送回監獄  你是那種人嗎

877
01:29:09,262 --> 01:29:11,471
You must've worked some dipshit crews.
你拘捕的一定是飯桶笨蛋

878
01:29:12,265 --> 01:29:14,474
I worked all kinds.
我拘捕各式各樣的人

879
01:29:17,478 --> 01:29:20,022
You see me doing thrill-seeking liquor-store holdups...
你幻想我身上有刺青

880
01:29:20,189 --> 01:29:22,524
...with a "Born to Lose" tattoo on my chest?
行劫酒鋪嗎

881
01:29:22,692 --> 01:29:25,527
- No, I do not. - Right.
- 不  我不會的  - 對

882
01:29:26,696 --> 01:29:28,530
I am never going back.
我不會再坐牢

883
01:29:30,158 --> 01:29:32,409
Then don't take down scores.
那麼便別再行劫

884
01:29:33,578 --> 01:29:36,204
I do what I do best, I take scores.
我做擅長做的事  我行劫

885
01:29:36,372 --> 01:29:40,000
You do what you do best, trying to stop guys like me.
你做擅長的事  阻止我

886
01:29:43,212 --> 01:29:46,048
So you never wanted a regular-type life?
你從不想過正常生活

887
01:29:46,215 --> 01:29:49,217
What the fuck is that? Barbecues and ball games?
是怎樣的  燒烤和踢足球嗎

888
01:29:50,970 --> 01:29:52,095
Yeah.
是的

889
01:29:54,557 --> 01:29:59,770
- This regular-type life like your life? - My life? No, my life...
- 你的生活正常嗎  - 我的生活  不  我的生活

890
01:30:00,730 --> 01:30:02,689
No, my life's a disaster zone.
一塌糊塗

891
01:30:04,442 --> 01:30:07,277
I got a stepdaughter so fucked up...
我的繼女情緒深受困擾

892
01:30:07,445 --> 01:30:10,530
...because her real father is this large-type asshole.
因為她的生父是個大混蛋

893
01:30:10,698 --> 01:30:14,576
I got a wife. We're passing each other on the down slope of a marriage...
我有太太  我的婚姻正頻臨破碎邊緣

894
01:30:14,744 --> 01:30:16,620
...my third...
第三次了

895
01:30:18,039 --> 01:30:21,708
...because I spend all my time chasing guys like you around the block.
因為我常花時間追捕你這樣的人

896
01:30:21,876 --> 01:30:23,919
That's my life.
那是我的生活

897
01:30:29,717 --> 01:30:31,968
A guy told me one time:
有人曾對我說

898
01:30:33,387 --> 01:30:35,514
Don't let yourself get attached to anything...
若你感到附近有警方監視

899
01:30:35,681 --> 01:30:38,391
...you are not willing to walk out on in 30 seconds flat...
便不能沾上任何不能脫身的事

900
01:30:38,559 --> 01:30:40,727
...if you feel the heat around the corner.
三十秒內  一走了之

901
01:30:41,771 --> 01:30:45,190
Now, if you're on me, and you gotta move when I move...
你想捉我  我行動時你亦行動

902
01:30:45,358 --> 01:30:48,527
...how do you expect to keep a marriage?
你如何能維持婚姻呢

903
01:30:50,321 --> 01:30:52,572
Well, that's an interesting point.
這說法很有趣

904
01:30:53,783 --> 01:30:55,951
What are you, a monk?
你是僧侶嗎

905
01:30:56,202 --> 01:30:57,911
I have a woman.
我有女伴

906
01:30:58,079 --> 01:31:00,080
What do you tell her?
你怎麼對她說

907
01:31:01,916 --> 01:31:04,042
I tell her I'm a salesman.
我告訴她  我是推銷員

908
01:31:10,383 --> 01:31:13,927
So then, if you spot me coming around that corner...
那麼若你見我從街角走來

909
01:31:14,595 --> 01:31:17,097
...you're just gonna walk out on this woman?
你會離開她嗎

910
01:31:17,890 --> 01:31:20,058
Not say goodbye?
不辭而別

911
01:31:20,309 --> 01:31:22,561
That's the discipline.
那是自律

912
01:31:22,770 --> 01:31:24,688
That's pretty vacant, no?
那很空泛

913
01:31:24,856 --> 01:31:26,523
Yeah, it is what it is.
正是如此

914
01:31:26,691 --> 01:31:29,317
It's that, or we both better go do something else, pal.
不這樣做  我們還是另找職業吧

915
01:31:31,445 --> 01:31:33,238
I don't know how to do anything else.
我不懂做別的

916
01:31:33,823 --> 01:31:35,699
Neither do I.
我也不懂

917
01:31:38,161 --> 01:31:41,621
- I don't much want to either. - Neither do I.
- 我不想做其他事  - 我也不想

918
01:31:49,297 --> 01:31:52,883
You know, I have this recurring dream.
我不斷重複這夢境

919
01:31:53,843 --> 01:31:56,511
I'm sitting at this big banquet table...
我坐在偌大的餐宴席上

920
01:31:56,679 --> 01:32:00,557
...and all the victims of all the murders I ever worked are sitting at this table...
我調查的兇案受害人均出席

921
01:32:00,725 --> 01:32:04,978
...and they're staring at me with these black eyeballs...
他們用黑色的眼珠子瞪望我

922
01:32:05,146 --> 01:32:10,150
...because they got eight-ball hemorrhages from the head wounds.
因為他們頭部中槍而出血

923
01:32:10,484 --> 01:32:13,987
And there they are, these big balloon people...
這些發脹的屍體在那兒

924
01:32:14,155 --> 01:32:17,240
...because I found them two weeks after they'd been under the bed.
因為他們被殺兩周後才在床下發現

925
01:32:18,075 --> 01:32:20,911
The neighbors reported the smell...
鄰居報稱有惡臭

926
01:32:21,454 --> 01:32:25,457
...and there they are, all of them just sitting there.
他們均有出席  所有人坐在那兒

927
01:32:27,168 --> 01:32:28,210
What do they say?
他們說什麼

928
01:32:30,421 --> 01:32:31,671
Nothing.
沒說話

929
01:32:31,839 --> 01:32:33,506
- No talk? - None.
- 沒人說話嗎  - 沒有

930
01:32:33,674 --> 01:32:37,302
Just... They don't have anything to say.
他們無話可說

931
01:32:37,929 --> 01:32:40,347
See, we just look at each other.
我們彼此望著對方

932
01:32:40,806 --> 01:32:45,644
They look at me. And that's it, that's the dream.
他們望著我  就是這樣  夢境是這樣

933
01:32:47,980 --> 01:32:50,398
I have one where I'm drowning.
我夢過自己溺水

934
01:32:50,691 --> 01:32:54,236
And I gotta wake myself up and start breathing, or I'll die in my sleep.
我得弄醒自己  開始呼吸  否則會死

935
01:32:56,447 --> 01:32:57,822
You know what that's about?
你知道這象徵著什麼嗎

936
01:32:58,324 --> 01:33:01,034
Yeah. Having enough time.
知道  有足夠的時間

937
01:33:02,578 --> 01:33:07,791
- Enough time to do what you wanna do? - That's right.
- 有足夠的時間做你想做的事嗎  - 是的

938
01:33:09,752 --> 01:33:13,380
- You doing it now? - No, not yet.
- 你正在這樣做嗎  - 還沒有

939
01:33:18,261 --> 01:33:20,553
You know, we're sitting here...
我們坐在這裏

940
01:33:21,597 --> 01:33:23,723
...you and I, like a couple of regular fellows.
一如常人

941
01:33:23,891 --> 01:33:26,601
You do what you do, and I do what I gotta do.
彼此做有需要的事

942
01:33:28,896 --> 01:33:31,898
And now that we've been face to face...
現在我們見過面

943
01:33:34,193 --> 01:33:39,197
...if I'm there and I gotta put you away, I won't like it.
若我要在案發現場殺你  我會不喜歡的

944
01:33:39,573 --> 01:33:40,699
But I'll tell you...
但是

945
01:33:43,244 --> 01:33:46,746
...if it's between you and some poor bastard...
若在你和

946
01:33:46,914 --> 01:33:49,416
...whose wife you're gonna turn into a widow...
被你殺死的人當中作選擇

947
01:33:50,251 --> 01:33:54,587
...brother, you are going down.
兄弟  沒命的會是你

948
01:34:06,309 --> 01:34:09,144
There's a flip side to that coin.
我有反面的看法

949
01:34:10,938 --> 01:34:15,275
What if you do got me boxed in and I gotta put you down?
若你真的使我走投無路  而我要殺你呢

950
01:34:16,569 --> 01:34:21,281
Because no matter what, you will not get in my way.
因為無論如何  你是無法阻止我的

951
01:34:21,991 --> 01:34:24,909
We've been face to face, yeah...
是的  我們見過面

952
01:34:27,538 --> 01:34:31,624
...but I will not hesitate. Not for a second.
但我會毫不猶疑殺你  一秒也不遲疑

953
01:34:37,465 --> 01:34:39,799
Maybe that's the way it'll be.
也許會這樣

954
01:34:41,635 --> 01:34:44,763
Or who knows?
或是誰曉得呢

955
01:34:44,972 --> 01:34:47,724
Or maybe we'll never see each other again.
也許我們會永遠不再見

956
01:35:03,240 --> 01:35:04,783
They dumped us.
他們擺脫了我們

957
01:35:06,118 --> 01:35:07,410
What?
什麼

958
01:35:07,578 --> 01:35:10,872
- They dumped us. - What do you mean, they dumped us?
- 他們逃脫了  - 什麼意思

959
01:35:11,040 --> 01:35:12,123
Chris slipped his tail.
基斯甩掉了跟蹤他的探員

960
01:35:12,291 --> 01:35:14,876
He doesn't talk about scores with Charlene...
他沒跟莎蓮談及買賣的事

961
01:35:15,044 --> 01:35:17,629
...so there's nothing for me to get from Marciano. I tried.
我無從向馬·亞倫套取資料

962
01:35:18,047 --> 01:35:20,048
- What about Cheritto? - Same.
- 查·米高呢  - 亦一樣

963
01:35:20,216 --> 01:35:22,967
Transponders got put on a bus to San Clemente.
異頻收發器放在公共汽車上

964
01:35:25,388 --> 01:35:29,849
- They dumped all our surveillance? - Yeah, at the same time. 9 p.m.
- 他們擺脫我們所有的監視了嗎  - 是的  同一時間  晚上九時

965
01:35:30,851 --> 01:35:34,187
I had coffee with McCauley half an hour ago!
我半小時前和麥·尼爾喝咖啡

966
01:35:34,355 --> 01:35:36,689
We were on you. Then McCauley drives into LAX...
之後他駛往機場

967
01:35:36,857 --> 01:35:39,859
...where surveillance can't fly over because of flight paths.
我們便無法飛去

968
01:35:40,027 --> 01:35:43,363
His car's still there. He's gone.
他的車仍在那兒  但人走了

969
01:35:47,785 --> 01:35:53,748
Does anybody have any idea where the fuck these people are?
有誰知道他們在哪兒嗎

970
01:36:52,391 --> 01:36:54,100
You hear from him yet?
他有聯絡嗎

971
01:36:54,268 --> 01:36:58,730
Not a thing. And not hearing bothers me more. Where's this guy?
沒有  這令我不安  他在哪兒

972
01:37:00,816 --> 01:37:05,528
This guy here. We put him on. Says he knows McCauley.
這人  我們僱用他  他說認識麥·尼爾

973
01:37:10,701 --> 01:37:11,743
Who are you?
你是誰

974
01:37:12,995 --> 01:37:16,789
Waingro. My name's Waingro.
榮谷  我叫榮谷

975
01:37:16,957 --> 01:37:20,543
I've been living in this office day and night. How well do you know him?
我等他電話  你很熟識他嗎

976
01:37:21,295 --> 01:37:24,797
Oh, we took some major scores together.
我們一起做過不少大買賣

977
01:37:27,760 --> 01:37:29,802
How come I haven't heard from him?
他為何沒找我

978
01:37:29,970 --> 01:37:33,806
Well, he's probably busy right now, but he's real thorough.
他可能忙著  但他行事很徹底

979
01:37:35,226 --> 01:37:39,103
- He ain't gonna forget about you. - Oh, that's reassuring.
- 他不會忘記你的  - 噢  那真令人安心

980
01:37:40,856 --> 01:37:44,025
Well, I got some moves I could make here.
我可在這兒出了力

981
01:37:44,527 --> 01:37:47,487
Probably be a big help to you.
可能對你會很有幫助

982
01:38:08,509 --> 01:38:09,842
You recognize the grill man?
認得那烤肉的人嗎

983
01:38:18,018 --> 01:38:22,313
- No. - Folsom. D-block. Housed with Dobie Rush.
- 不認識  - 霍森監獄  D座的  和杜比同一囚室

984
01:38:23,732 --> 01:38:27,527
- Ain't got my break yet, man. - Cisco and Pancho didn't show.
- 我還沒有小休  - 薜哥和彭曹沒上班

985
01:38:27,695 --> 01:38:30,697
Haul out the garbage. Mop up the back.
扔垃圾  到餐廳後抹地

986
01:38:30,864 --> 01:38:32,824
Take your break later.
稍後再休息吧

987
01:38:32,992 --> 01:38:36,327
Piece of shit. Pick up.
人渣  端菜

988
01:38:39,081 --> 01:38:40,832
Where the hell is he?
他在哪兒

989
01:38:41,000 --> 01:38:44,335
- I wanted to check the slot for a work car. - So did I.
- 我查看車場  看車是否仍在那兒  - 我也去

990
01:38:49,508 --> 01:38:50,925
Yeah?
是我

991
01:38:52,136 --> 01:38:53,636
Hang on.
等一等

992
01:38:54,013 --> 01:38:55,930
- Yeah. - Hey.
- 喂  - 嘿

993
01:38:56,098 --> 01:39:00,643
Use a landline. Call me at 103-7206.
用普通電話  撥號103-7206

994
01:39:00,811 --> 01:39:02,061
All right.
好的

995
01:39:12,948 --> 01:39:15,074
- Where are you? - There's cops all over me, man.
- 你在哪兒  - 到處有警察監視我

996
01:39:15,242 --> 01:39:19,245
They're on me like a cheap suit. I can't dump them.
我無法擺脫他們

997
01:39:21,749 --> 01:39:25,710
- After the fact you spotted them? - No, no. They're doing parallels.
- 他們知道你發現他們了嗎  - 不  沒有  他們平衡緊帖我

998
01:39:28,589 --> 01:39:30,006
I can try to dump them again.
我再試試擺脫他們

999
01:39:30,174 --> 01:39:34,552
How are we gonna know if you did? If you didn't, you'll draw them to us.
