1165
02:00:10,371 --> 02:00:13,164
Drucker's got a safe house in Venice to stash her in.
澤加在威尼斯區有地方收藏她

1166
02:00:13,332 --> 02:00:16,543
Our Neil's transportation. When we're done here, get on the phone.
尼爾的逃走方法

1167
02:00:16,711 --> 02:00:19,254
Somewhere, someone's trying to put it together for him.
正有人替他安排一切

1168
02:00:19,422 --> 02:00:21,798
You don't believe McCauley already had a getaway?
你不會認為他已經有計劃了吧

1169
02:00:21,966 --> 02:00:26,344
Sure he did. Now he needs another one. Would you trust yours after this afternoon?
他當然有計劃  但他需要另一個計劃  換成你還能相信原來的計劃嗎

1170
02:00:27,388 --> 02:00:29,723
This rat motherfucker, where did we get him?
這告密的混蛋  哪兒找到他的

1171
02:00:29,891 --> 02:00:33,435
He's a CI for a burglary cop. Called in the tip on the bank.
他是機密線人  通報劫銀行線索

1172
02:00:33,603 --> 02:00:37,147
On Neil McCauley, how much time we got?
談談麥·尼爾吧  還有多少時間

1173
02:00:37,315 --> 02:00:40,692
Eight, 10 hours for him to set up a new out. After that, he's gone.
他有八至十小時安排新逃走路線  之後  他就走了

1174
02:00:40,860 --> 02:00:42,819
Bye-bye. Bam.
拜拜了

1175
02:01:35,665 --> 02:01:40,085
You ratted McCauley to us. How'd you know? Who told you?
你向我們告發麥·尼爾  你怎麼知道  誰告訴你的

1176
02:01:40,252 --> 02:01:42,879
Who told you, you rat motherfucker?
是誰告訴你的  混蛋

1177
02:01:43,047 --> 02:01:44,673
Who?
是誰

1178
02:02:12,576 --> 02:02:15,954
Connelly back in for Murphy. Murphy with Leggat right there with him.
康尼回來阻擊墨菲  墨菲在奮力拼搶

1179
02:02:16,122 --> 02:02:17,914
Murphy tees it up behind the net...
得球後  準備打門

1180
02:02:22,086 --> 02:02:25,296
...Miller out front. Now here's Murphy with the referee...
米勒也衝到了前場

1181
02:02:28,884 --> 02:02:30,051
Waingro, where is he?
榮谷在哪兒

1182
02:02:31,429 --> 02:02:33,680
- Where is he? - How the hell would I know?
- 在哪兒  - 我怎麼知道

1183
02:02:59,457 --> 02:03:03,376
Well, what do we have here, hmm?
嗯  這兒有些什麼

1184
02:03:03,836 --> 02:03:07,464
Isn't this pretty? It's pretty.
這兒漂亮嗎  漂亮嗎

1185
02:03:09,925 --> 02:03:12,969
- You slimy piece of shit. - You told me you wanted out from under.
- 你這個小人  - 你告訴我想脫離目前的困境

1186
02:03:13,137 --> 02:03:16,306
You're scared to death, right? You want out? This is out, Charlene.
你想脫身嗎  這是出路

1187
02:03:16,474 --> 02:03:20,143
- Yeah, what's your end? - I... You stupid broad.
- 你得到什麼好處啦  - 我沒好處  你這個蠢娘們

1188
02:03:20,311 --> 02:03:22,771
- How'd I get into this? - Hey, hey, hey. Easy.
- 我怎麼會牽涉此事的  - 嘿  冷靜  別衝動

1189
02:03:22,938 --> 02:03:24,147
You heard me.
你聽到我說的了

1190
02:03:24,315 --> 02:03:27,358
She had a rough ride. Why don't you fix her a drink or something?
她已經夠難受的了  你為何不給她倒杯酒呢

1191
02:03:27,526 --> 02:03:30,528
- Look in the cabinet above the sink. - Fuck her.
- 到櫥櫃看看  - 去她的

1192
02:03:32,948 --> 02:03:36,076
- You'd better get in there and stay in there. - All right, all right.
- 你最好進去  不要出來  - 好吧

1193
02:03:38,829 --> 02:03:41,081
Well, lookie here.
看看這兒

1194
02:03:42,249 --> 02:03:44,542
My name is Sergeant Drucker, L.A.P.D. Homicide.
我是澤加  洛城警局  兇殺組探員

1195
02:03:44,710 --> 02:03:48,713
- You wanna put Dominick in the bedroom? - He stays with me.
- 要送多明進睡房嗎  - 他和我待在一起

1196
02:03:49,215 --> 02:03:51,132
There we go.
坐下

1197
02:03:58,724 --> 02:04:00,683
So, what now?
現在怎麼辦

1198
02:04:02,937 --> 02:04:06,689
Well, he's right, because you want out, this is out.
他說得對  你想脫身  這是出路

1199
02:04:08,109 --> 02:04:11,986
- You believe you have to betray Chris. - No shit.
- 你真的要出賣基斯嗎  - 正是

1200
02:04:12,154 --> 02:04:15,115
That's right. You would have to.
這就對了  你是得這樣做

1201
02:04:15,282 --> 02:04:19,536
See, if you don't betray Chris, you victimize Dominick.
若不出賣基斯  多明會是受害人

1202
02:04:20,037 --> 02:04:23,248
Because he becomes an orphan when you go to prison as an accessory...
因為當你入獄時  他便會成為孤兒

1203
02:04:23,415 --> 02:04:25,875
...because you got no living parents to take him.
你也沒有父母來照顧他

1204
02:04:26,043 --> 02:04:30,421
So he ends up state-raised in foster homes, juvenile facilities.
他會被送進收養所  青少年中心

1205
02:04:30,589 --> 02:04:32,841
Then he steals a car.
之後他會偷車

1206
02:04:33,092 --> 02:04:38,263
Then he winds up in gladiator academies like Chino and Tracy.
然後入獄學會做真正的罪犯

1207
02:04:38,430 --> 02:04:41,724
Fucked for life.
毀了一生

1208
02:04:41,892 --> 02:04:45,228
You know what happens, because you've been there.
你是過來人  知道會有何下場

1209
02:04:46,397 --> 02:04:51,568
Dominick didn't get a chance yet to choose his life, but Chris did.
多明沒機會選擇生活  但基斯有

1210
02:04:52,653 --> 02:04:56,239
If you give up Chris, you get off clean.
你若供出基斯  你會沒有案底

1211
02:04:56,407 --> 02:05:00,326
You can do it for your kid, so you can raise him.
你可以為了孩子而這樣做  你可以撫養他

1212
02:05:04,498 --> 02:05:07,876
- What else are you selling? - All kinds of shit.
- 你還有什麼條件  - 各種各樣的東西

1213
02:05:08,752 --> 02:05:13,965
But I don't have to sell this and you know it, because this kind of shit here sells itself.
但我不用說服你  因為我是對的

1214
02:05:20,264 --> 02:05:22,265
Okay, Danny, here's an update.
最新消息

1215
02:05:22,433 --> 02:05:25,768
- Drucker's on Line 2. - Lieutenant, hold on for a second.
- 澤加在二線  - 等一等

1216
02:05:27,938 --> 02:05:30,064
Lieutenant, I have Drucker on the other line.
澤加在另一電話線

1217
02:05:30,232 --> 02:05:31,608
Oh, well, conference him in.
三人通話吧

1218
02:05:33,110 --> 02:05:36,821
- Go ahead. - Vincent, it's me.
- 說吧  - 雲信  是我

1219
02:05:38,741 --> 02:05:41,367
I want an answer. What's it gonna be?
你的答覆是怎樣的

1220
02:05:47,958 --> 02:05:50,460
We're set here. She'll make the call.
我們準備好了  她會打電話

1221
02:05:50,628 --> 02:05:53,796
Okay, that's good. Here's the deal here.
好的  情況是這樣

1222
02:05:53,964 --> 02:05:59,802
Hugh Benny has reformed his wayward life and become a born-again good citizen.
許·班尼已改過自新  成為洗心革面的好市民

1223
02:05:59,970 --> 02:06:04,515
Apparently, Neil got sold out to us by this cowboy named Waingro.
叫榮谷的人向我們出賣了尼爾

1224
02:06:04,683 --> 02:06:07,435
Waingro used to be a part of Neil's crew...
榮谷曾是他手下

1225
02:06:07,603 --> 02:06:11,189
...then he went to work for a money launderer named Van Zant.
後替洗錢人工作  他叫宏山

1226
02:06:11,357 --> 02:06:17,153
Units are at Van Zant's house as we speak because he got shot dead earlier tonight.
現時正派人前住宏山家中  因為他今晚較早前被殺

1227
02:06:17,488 --> 02:06:20,823
Now, if Neil goes after anybody else, it's gonna be Waingro.
尼爾要對付的人會是榮谷

1228
02:06:20,991 --> 02:06:24,327
Waingro just got himself a suite at the airport Marquis...
榮谷正入住侯爵機場酒店套房

1229
02:06:24,495 --> 02:06:27,872
...under the name "Jameson". He's there now.
並化名詹美臣  他正在那兒

1230
02:06:28,040 --> 02:06:31,125
I want you to get that to bail bondsmen, bookies...
我要你把這消息告訴外圍帶家

1231
02:06:31,293 --> 02:06:34,504
...assignment officers and snitches in County.
奉派警員及線人

1232
02:06:34,672 --> 02:06:37,048
Anyone you can think of who'll put it on the street.
任何能把消息外洩的人

1233
02:06:37,216 --> 02:06:41,386
Deploy a team at the hotel and personally check their come every 30 minutes.
派人到酒店駐守  並每隔半小時收聽無線電

1234
02:06:41,553 --> 02:06:45,640
Because maybe Neil will go for him. Okay? How you feeling?
也許尼爾會殺他  明白嗎  你感覺怎麼樣

1235
02:06:46,350 --> 02:06:49,602
- Banged up, but I'll live. - Okay.
- 不算太慘  我會活著  - 很好

1236
02:06:56,986 --> 02:06:58,861
He's here.
他仍在

1237
02:06:59,154 --> 02:07:01,364
Neil is still here.
尼爾還沒走

1238
02:07:01,907 --> 02:07:03,866
I can feel it.
我能感覺到

1239
02:07:04,118 --> 02:07:06,661
But for how long?
會留多久

1240
02:07:07,246 --> 02:07:10,164
Seven, eight hours, max.
最多七八個小時

1241
02:07:18,549 --> 02:07:19,882
What did you do?
你做過什麼

1242
02:07:20,592 --> 02:07:24,304
- That was you? - It's what I don't do, I don't sell metal.
- 是你做的嗎  - 我不是賣金屬的

1243
02:07:24,471 --> 02:07:27,390
Would have been okay, you fly out after. Now it's jammed.
計劃原本順利  但現在出了麻煩

1244
02:07:27,558 --> 02:07:31,561
- Now we gotta go together. - Those other people were with you?
- 我們要一起走  - 那些人和你一起的嗎

1245
02:07:33,689 --> 02:07:35,815
My friend, Michael...
我的朋友米高

1246
02:07:36,900 --> 02:07:39,527
...he knew the risks. He didn't have to be there.
他知道所冒的險

1247
02:07:43,532 --> 02:07:46,159
It rains, you get wet.
身處險境便要冒生命危險

1248
02:07:48,203 --> 02:07:49,412
Get packed and let's go.
收拾東西

1249
02:07:56,587 --> 02:07:59,255
Eady.
伊荻

1250
02:08:09,016 --> 02:08:12,268
Why did you do this to me?
你為何這樣對我

1251
02:08:17,775 --> 02:08:19,817
Who are you?
你究竟是誰

1252
02:08:22,654 --> 02:08:25,782
It's gonna be all right. You understand? It'll be all right.
不會有事的  明白嗎

1253
02:08:30,662 --> 02:08:32,789
It's gonna be all right.
不會有事的

1254
02:08:33,791 --> 02:08:35,416
Right.
不會的

1255
02:08:44,009 --> 02:08:47,637
There's this Camaro at this address, Level D, Slot 18.
這個地址  D層十八單位  有一輛汽車

1256
02:08:52,351 --> 02:08:54,394
Here's some cash.
這兒有現金

1257
02:08:56,980 --> 02:08:58,147
When's it over?
此事何時瞭解

1258
02:09:01,652 --> 02:09:03,194
22 hours from now.
二十二小時後

1259
02:09:03,654 --> 02:09:07,365
- Then we get out of here clean. - When will you let me leave?
- 那時我們便可脫身  - 那時你會讓我離開嗎

1260
02:09:11,286 --> 02:09:14,163
Go now. You want out? There's the door.
那現在就走吧  你想離開嗎  門在那邊

1261
02:09:14,832 --> 02:09:16,999
Will you let me leave later?
你稍後會讓我離開嗎

1262
02:09:22,089 --> 02:09:24,298
It will be different.
情況會不同

1263
02:09:25,342 --> 02:09:27,510
Do you understand?
你還不明白嗎

1264
02:09:58,000 --> 02:09:59,542
It's ready.
準備好了

1265
02:09:59,710 --> 02:10:01,544
Vincent.
雲信

1266
02:10:06,967 --> 02:10:09,135
This is my friend Ralph.
這是我的朋友洛夫

1267
02:10:09,303 --> 02:10:11,262
You didn't tell me you were...
你沒說你已已經

1268
02:10:12,347 --> 02:10:15,224
- Oh, my God. - Where's Lauren?
- 天啊  - 羅蘭在哪兒

1269
02:10:15,392 --> 02:10:18,603
- She's at Lisa-Beth's. - Look, this has nothing to do with me.
- 她在碧芙家中  - 聽著  此事和我無關

1270
02:10:18,770 --> 02:10:22,690
- I didn't know. I'm terribly sorry. - What are you sorry about? Sit down.
- 我不知道  對不起  - 對不起什麼  坐下

1271
02:10:23,358 --> 02:10:25,401
Don't you even get angry?
你不生氣嗎

1272
02:10:25,569 --> 02:10:28,070
I'm angry, yeah.
我當然生氣

1273
02:10:28,238 --> 02:10:30,656
I'm very angry, Ralph.
我非常生氣  洛夫

1274
02:10:30,824 --> 02:10:33,910
You know, you can ball my wife if she wants you to.
若她想要你干她  你可以干我太太

1275
02:10:35,496 --> 02:10:38,581
You can lounge around here on her sofa.
你可以躺在她的沙發上

1276
02:10:39,917 --> 02:10:42,210
In her ex-husband's...
在她前夫的

1277
02:10:42,377 --> 02:10:47,423
...dead-tech, post-modernistic, bullshit house, if you want to...
高科技後現代主義的荒謬家中  若你想的話

1278
02:10:49,259 --> 02:10:55,598
...but you do not get to watch my fucking television set!
但你不能看我該死的電視機

1279
02:10:55,766 --> 02:10:57,266
For God's sake.
天啊

1280
02:11:03,815 --> 02:11:05,608
Put the television set down.
把電視機放下

1281
02:11:05,776 --> 02:11:08,319
- I never cheated on you, bitch. - Maybe you should have.
- 我沒對你不忠  賤貨  - 也許你應該

1282
02:11:08,487 --> 02:11:10,780
- I should have? - In a way, you're a party to this.
- 我應該嗎  - 你對此也有責任

1283
02:11:10,948 --> 02:11:13,991
Oh, yeah. I made Ralph fuck you because it makes me feel good.
沒錯  我要洛夫干你  因為這使我開心

1284
02:11:14,159 --> 02:11:15,326
Our situation is absurd.
我們的處境荒謬

1285
02:11:17,037 --> 02:11:21,874
- Look, maybe I should... - Shut up, Ralph. Sit down!
- 聽著  也許我該走了  - 住口  洛夫  坐下

1286
02:11:23,961 --> 02:11:27,880
Why is it that I have to figure things out and explain them to you? What do you do?
我為何要向你把事情解釋清楚  你又做什麼了

1287
02:11:28,048 --> 02:11:31,884
- I say what I mean, and I do what I say. - Mm, how admirable.
- 我說話算話  亦言出必行  - 哼  多麼可敬

1288
02:11:32,052 --> 02:11:34,136
- You bet. - Except none of it's about us.
- 那當然  - 可是沒什麼是和我們有關的

1289
02:11:34,972 --> 02:11:36,013
No.
是的

1290
02:11:37,474 --> 02:11:41,060
I may be stoned on grass and Prozac...
我一定是抽大麻或服興奮劑迷糊了

1291
02:11:41,228 --> 02:11:43,854
...but you've been walking through our life dead.
但你在我們的生活中猶如死了

1292
02:11:44,022 --> 02:11:48,693
Now I have to demean myself with Ralph just to get closure with you.
我不得不作踐自己  找洛夫來終斷我們的關係

1293
02:12:01,248 --> 02:12:03,499
Passports, traveler's checks, plastic.
護照  旅行支票  信用卡

1294
02:12:04,167 --> 02:12:09,005
The plane, charter terminal, LAX, Hangar 17.
這飛機  在洛城機場包機站十七號機庫

1295
02:12:09,172 --> 02:12:10,923
Call letters are 1011 Sierra.
確定密碼是一零一一山嶺

1296
02:12:14,303 --> 02:12:18,014
Touches down, holds for you five minutes, then splits.
飛機會降落  等你五分鐘  然後便起飛

1297
02:12:18,181 --> 02:12:21,684
The plane will stand an FAA check. Filed a flight plan, the works.
飛機會通過航空局檢查等手續

1298
02:12:23,687 --> 02:12:26,022
- Hey, where's Chris? - He's gone.
- 基斯呢  - 他走了

1299
02:12:27,482 --> 02:12:28,524
What?
什麼

1300
02:12:29,151 --> 02:12:31,694
Said he's going on his own. Went to look for Charlene.
他說去找莎蓮  他走了

1301
02:12:31,862 --> 02:12:34,697
- Didn't you bring him here? - Yeah, I brought him here.
- 是你帶他來這兒的嗎  - 是的  我帶他來了

1302
02:12:35,157 --> 02:12:36,991
What happened?
怎麼回事

1303
02:12:37,159 --> 02:12:39,535
It's a free country, brother.
這是個自由國家

1304
02:12:43,957 --> 02:12:48,377
Check in with me at 9. Everything's still cool.
晚上九時聯絡我  確保一切妥當

1305
02:12:49,713 --> 02:12:51,380
All right.
好的

1306
02:13:13,945 --> 02:13:16,906
I don't even know what I'm doing anymore.
我甚至不知道自己在做什麼

1307
02:13:19,785 --> 02:13:21,994
I know life is short.
我知道人生苦短

1308
02:13:22,245 --> 02:13:24,872
Whatever time you get is luck.
能活多久是運氣

1309
02:13:27,084 --> 02:13:29,168
You wanna walk?
你想終斷這段關係

1310
02:13:31,421 --> 02:13:33,714
You walk right now.
你現在就能離開

1311
02:13:34,800 --> 02:13:36,926
Or on your own...
或者你自願

1312
02:13:37,094 --> 02:13:40,137
On your own, you choose to come with me.
你自願選擇跟我一起走

1313
02:13:46,228 --> 02:13:48,270
All I know is...
我只知道

1314
02:13:50,065 --> 02:13:54,402
All I know is there's no point in me going anywhere anymore...
我無論到任何地方去  都將失去意義

1315
02:13:54,945 --> 02:13:57,029
...if it's gonna be alone...
因為只有我獨自一人

1316
02:13:57,948 --> 02:13:59,740
...without you.
沒有你陪在身邊

1317
02:14:06,581 --> 02:14:08,165
Eady.
伊荻

1318
02:14:57,883 --> 02:15:00,342
- Yeah. - Yeah, Vincent, I got a live one.
- 喂  - 雲信  我抓了個活的

1319
02:15:01,052 --> 02:15:02,678
Okay, I'll hold.
好  我等著

1320
02:15:05,348 --> 02:15:06,724
Come on, sugar. Show yourself.
過去  讓基斯看見你

1321
02:15:07,851 --> 02:15:09,685
- Yeah, do it. - Shut up!
- 快去啊  - 住口

1322
02:15:13,940 --> 02:15:16,650
Now, just one second at the window...
只需在窗前站一秒

1323
02:15:17,444 --> 02:15:19,195
...and it's all over.
此事便會了結

1324
02:17:09,180 --> 02:17:10,848
Hey, man.
朋友

1325
02:17:11,099 --> 02:17:13,058
- Yeah? - You know any, uh...
- 幹嘛  - 你知道

1326
02:17:13,226 --> 02:17:16,020
...place to rent around here?
這附近有地方要出租嗎

1327
02:17:17,105 --> 02:17:18,230
Yeah.
知道

1328
02:17:18,398 --> 02:17:20,983
Alberiz's Grocer on Dell Avenue got cards on the wall.
那邊牆上有告示

1329
02:17:21,151 --> 02:17:22,192
Yeah, thanks.
好的  謝謝

1330
02:17:33,413 --> 02:17:36,081
It's not him. It's not Chris.
不是他  不是基斯

1331
02:17:43,757 --> 02:17:45,883
Unit 2, this is Command.
是指揮部

1332
02:17:46,051 --> 02:17:48,719
Take him at the street and check him out.
攔住他  核實他的身份

1333
02:17:48,887 --> 02:17:50,387
10-4.
收到

1334
02:18:13,828 --> 02:18:15,788
- Sergeant? - Yeah.
- 警官  - 說

1335
02:18:15,956 --> 02:18:18,540
This guy's John Peterson. Valid ID.
他叫莊·彼得  有效的身份證

1336
02:18:18,708 --> 02:18:22,461
Car's registered to the last name Bukowski, first name Gene.
車輛登記人是布·基贊

1337
02:18:22,629 --> 02:18:25,506
Ran it to DMV. It's clean.
向運輸署查核過  沒有不妥

1338
02:18:28,218 --> 02:18:31,053
- Let him go. - Roger.
- 讓他走  - 收到

1339
02:18:31,221 --> 02:18:33,555
Thank you very much. Have a good evening.
非常感謝  祝你晚安

1340
02:18:35,308 --> 02:18:37,267
It's a no-go, Vince.
不是他  雲信

1341
02:18:46,361 --> 02:18:49,154
Would you like a cup of coffee while we wait, Mrs. Shiherlis?
我們等時你想喝咖啡嗎

1342
02:18:49,322 --> 02:18:51,407
Yeah, that'd be nice.
那會很不錯

1343
02:19:21,396 --> 02:19:23,397
- Yeah? - Yeah, what do you got?
- 喂  - 你有什麼消息

1344
02:19:23,565 --> 02:19:25,649
Nothing's happening.
沒事發生

1345
02:19:36,953 --> 02:19:40,289
- Yeah? - Hello, it's Vincent.
- 喂  - 我是雲信

1346
02:19:40,457 --> 02:19:41,457
What do you got?
有何動靜

1347
02:19:41,624 --> 02:19:45,961
Nothing's going on. Waingro went for ice. That's it.
沒有  榮谷去拿冰塊了

1348
02:19:54,304 --> 02:19:56,138
You know what?
你知道嗎

1349
02:19:58,141 --> 02:20:00,184
Neil is gone.
尼爾跑了

1350
02:20:02,395 --> 02:20:04,021
Bam!
走了

1351
02:20:04,606 --> 02:20:08,025
- Flying like a bird. - Come on, Vincent, how do you know?
- 像鳥兒般飛走  - 行了  雲信  你怎麼知道

1352
02:20:10,320 --> 02:20:13,363
- We still got bait. Maybe some time! - Got, got. What do we got?
- 我們還有機會  也許仍有時間  - 得了  我們有什麼

1353
02:20:13,531 --> 02:20:15,365
What do we got?
我們有什麼

1354
02:20:15,784 --> 02:20:18,452
Bon voyage, motherfucker.
一路順風  混蛋

1355
02:20:19,162 --> 02:20:21,371
You were good.
你很了不起

1356
02:20:22,457 --> 02:20:23,999
I'm going to the hotel.
我要回酒店去

1357
02:20:25,418 --> 02:20:27,878
I'm gonna take a shower.
我要洗澡

1358
02:20:28,463 --> 02:20:31,965
Gonna sleep for a month.
好好睡覺  睡一個月

1359
02:22:41,888 --> 02:22:43,680
Over here.
來

1360
02:22:50,355 --> 02:22:52,272
Come on, baby.
醒來吧

1361
02:22:54,234 --> 02:22:56,526
Okay, okay.
好了

1362
02:22:59,989 --> 02:23:01,949
Shit.
不要

1363
02:23:02,825 --> 02:23:04,826
Let me tighten this.
讓我綁緊胳膊

1364
02:23:10,333 --> 02:23:12,334
What a fucking waste.
浪費生命

1365
02:23:12,502 --> 02:23:14,836
Okay, here.
好了  來了

1366
02:23:15,672 --> 02:23:21,385
Assholes shoot themselves all fucking day. Not you, baby. Not you.
每天都有混蛋自殺  但你不是混蛋  寶貝  你不會死的

1367
02:23:26,224 --> 02:23:29,685
Where would she be? Her name is Lauren, Lauren Gustafson.
她會在哪兒  她叫羅蘭  古·羅蘭

1368
02:23:29,852 --> 02:23:32,104
I'm supposed to be here with her. But the police...
她該在這兒的

1369
02:23:39,028 --> 02:23:42,197
- Help me. I need somebody to help... - It's okay.
- 我要人幫忙  - 沒事兒的

1370
02:23:43,658 --> 02:23:45,242
I got you.
我抱著你

1371
02:23:47,870 --> 02:23:49,037
I got you, baby.
我抱著你呢  寶貝

1372
02:23:50,373 --> 02:23:53,709
It'll be all right, honey. I swear. It's okay, baby.
你會沒事的  你會沒事的  寶貝

1373
02:23:53,876 --> 02:23:57,921
Let's get a doctor! Let's go! A doctor here! There's your mama.
快找醫生來  你媽媽來了

1374
02:23:58,089 --> 02:23:59,965
- Let's just calm down. - Your mama's here.
- 冷靜下來  - 你媽媽在這兒

1375
02:24:00,133 --> 02:24:01,967
- Is she on any drugs? - No.
- 她是吸毒了嗎  - 不是

1376
02:24:04,887 --> 02:24:07,681
I want you to get a trauma surgeon and a vascular surgeon.
找精神創傷及血管醫生來

1377
02:24:07,849 --> 02:24:11,101
I think she cut both arteries. Also, I could hardly feel her pulse.
她割斷了兩條動脈  我摸不到她的脈搏

1378
02:24:11,269 --> 02:24:14,604
Her pressure's down. So is her respiration. You have to intubate her.
她的血壓很低  呼吸也很微弱  要給她插管

1379
02:24:14,772 --> 02:24:16,481
It's ready.
準備好了

1380
02:24:17,984 --> 02:24:21,153
- When's the last time anybody saw her? - I don't know.
- 最後一次見她時是什麼時候  - 我不知道

1381
02:24:21,321 --> 02:24:24,406
- Where did you find her? - The bathtub.
- 你在哪兒找到她的  - 浴缸

1382
02:24:24,574 --> 02:24:28,118
Call Respiratory stat. Give her large-bore normal saline. Wide open.
給她注射大針管的鹽水

1383
02:24:28,286 --> 02:24:31,413
Let's keep pressure on those bleeders. I need two units, O-negative.
緊按出血的血管  先輸入兩個單位O型血

1384
02:24:31,581 --> 02:24:34,624
- Let's type and cross her for six. - Looks like she's in sinus tach.
- 查明血型後再輸入六個單位相同的  - 看來她已經竇性心律過速

1385
02:24:34,792 --> 02:24:36,668
Where is Respiratory? We need more help.
呼吸專家呢  我們需要幫忙

1386
02:24:36,836 --> 02:24:38,628
Can you have Respiratory come now?
快叫呼吸科醫生過來

1387
02:24:38,796 --> 02:24:41,506
Let's have x-ray ready for post-intubation chest x-ray.
準備插管後照X光

1388
02:24:46,512 --> 02:24:51,141
Hi. Your daughter's out of surgery and she's in the recovery room now, okay?
嗨  你的女兒已經做好手術  正在療養室

1389
02:24:51,309 --> 02:24:55,479
Her vital signs are stable. The surgeon will be out to speak to you in a few moments.
她情況穩定  醫生很快會跟你說

1390
02:24:55,646 --> 02:24:57,522
- She's okay? - She's doing good.
- 她沒事吧  - 她很好

1391
02:24:57,690 --> 02:24:59,858
- She's gonna be okay. - She's gonna be okay.
- 她會好起來的  - 她會好起來的

1392
02:25:00,026 --> 02:25:02,903
- Oh, my baby. - She's gonna be okay. It's all right.
- 噢  我的寶貝  - 她會好起來的  沒事了

1393
02:25:03,071 --> 02:25:06,198
- It's all right. - Why'd she do this to herself? Why?
- 沒事了  - 她為何這樣對待自己

1394
02:25:06,366 --> 02:25:10,577
Look what she did. Look what she did to herself.
看她把自己怎麼了

1395
02:25:11,621 --> 02:25:13,455
There.
好了

1396
02:25:13,873 --> 02:25:16,792
It's all right, honey. It's gonna be all right.
沒事的  不會有事的

1397
02:25:16,959 --> 02:25:19,002
I'm here. I ain't going anywhere.
我在這兒  不會到別處去

1398
02:25:19,170 --> 02:25:20,212
- You understand? - Yeah.
- 明白嗎  - 嗯

1399
02:25:20,380 --> 02:25:22,464
I ain't going anywhere.
我不會到別處去

1400
02:25:35,269 --> 02:25:36,269
Yeah?
喂

1401
02:25:36,771 --> 02:25:37,771
It's me.
是我

1402
02:25:38,356 --> 02:25:41,608
Plane's in the air now. It'll be right on time.
飛機已在半空  你得準時到達

1403
02:25:41,818 --> 02:25:45,821
On the driver's end, I still can't find nobody, so that's in the trust.
可信任的司機仍找不到

1404
02:25:45,988 --> 02:25:47,864
One other thing.
還有一事

1405
02:25:48,324 --> 02:25:49,908
You asked, so I gotta tell you.
你問過我  所以我得告訴你

1406
02:25:50,743 --> 02:25:53,620
The guy you wanted checked into the Marquis under "Jameson"...
你找的人在候爵酒店  化名詹美臣

1407
02:25:53,788 --> 02:25:57,165
...if you still give a shit, which I figured you wouldn't.
我看你不想找他了吧

1408
02:25:57,333 --> 02:26:01,086
- You figured right. - So, so long, brother.
- 你說得對  - 那麼  再見  兄弟

1409
02:26:02,797 --> 02:26:04,756
You take it easy.
多保重

1410
02:26:04,924 --> 02:26:06,508
You're home free.
你自由了

1411
02:26:08,261 --> 02:26:10,220
Take it easy.
你也保重

1412
02:26:20,565 --> 02:26:23,316
- What is it? - Nothing.
- 什麼事  - 沒事

1413
02:26:23,484 --> 02:26:25,026
Home free.
自由了

1414
02:27:02,982 --> 02:27:05,901
- I gotta take care of something. - Is there time?
- 我得解決一些事情  - 還有時間嗎

1415
02:27:06,903 --> 02:27:08,570
There's time.
有的

1416
02:27:36,974 --> 02:27:40,101
I'll be right back. Just leave her running.
我很快回來  讓車子開動吧

1417
02:28:21,519 --> 02:28:23,979
- Registration. - Yeah, this is Room Service.
- 入住登記處  - 我是房間餐飲部

1418
02:28:24,146 --> 02:28:27,983
A Jameson ordered a BLT. They screwed up his room number. Could you give it to me?
詹美臣要了食物  但房號弄錯了  你能告訴我嗎

1419
02:28:28,150 --> 02:28:30,026
- They're always doing that. - Yeah, I know.
- 他們經常會弄錯  - 我知道

1420
02:28:30,194 --> 02:28:33,280
- 1735. - Thank you.
- 是一七三五號房  - 謝謝

1421
02:30:16,759 --> 02:30:18,468
Your attention, please.
請注意

1422
02:30:18,636 --> 02:30:21,888
We are currently experiencing a fire alarm.
現在響起火警警報

1423
02:30:22,056 --> 02:30:25,433
Please do not panic. Please do not take the elevators.
不用惶恐  不要乘坐升降機

1424
02:30:29,438 --> 02:30:32,065
Shit. Waingro's not moving. I'm staying here.
該死  榮谷沒走  我留在這兒

1425
02:30:32,233 --> 02:30:35,819
I'm checking the stairs. If there's smoke, I'm pulling you out.
我查看樓梯  若有煙  便會要你走

1426
02:30:40,116 --> 02:30:42,534
What about her dad? You want me to call him?
我該通知她父親嗎

1427
02:30:43,536 --> 02:30:46,371
He's somewhere in the Sierras.
他在內華達山脈某處

1428
02:30:47,832 --> 02:30:49,999
And she chose you.
她選擇了你

1429
02:30:52,002 --> 02:30:54,379
She picked your place.
選擇在你的房間自殺

1430
02:30:55,923 --> 02:30:57,403
It's not right, what happened to her.
這樣做是不對的  不該發生在她身上

1431
02:30:59,051 --> 02:31:00,385
No, it's not.
是的

1432
02:31:03,806 --> 02:31:05,849
Ugh, okay.
好了

1433
02:31:16,026 --> 02:31:18,153
Is there any way...
是否有方法

1434
02:31:20,114 --> 02:31:22,615
...that it could work out between us?
能克服我們之間的問題

1435
02:31:24,994 --> 02:31:27,579
I wish I could say yes, you know.
我希望說有

1436
02:31:27,747 --> 02:31:31,040
But in the end...
可是  到最後

1437
02:31:35,504 --> 02:31:37,672
You know, it's like you said:
就像你說的

1438
02:31:40,384 --> 02:31:45,054
All I am, is what I'm going after.
我沉迷於  追捕我的罪犯

1439
02:31:51,937 --> 02:31:54,856
I'm not what you want, Justine.
我不是你想要的人

1440
02:32:05,326 --> 02:32:07,952
Well, go on, if you have to.
若你要走  便走吧

1441
02:32:08,120 --> 02:32:09,704
No.
不

1442
02:32:09,997 --> 02:32:13,208
- I'll stay. - No, I'm okay. I can... I can handle this.
- 我會留下  - 我沒事  我可以應付

1443
02:32:16,378 --> 02:32:18,379
Just be careful.
你保重

1444
02:32:18,631 --> 02:32:21,382
Call me here. Let me know you're okay.
給我打電話  讓我知道你沒事

1445
02:32:22,301 --> 02:32:23,843
Okay?
好嗎

1446
02:33:05,719 --> 02:33:06,761
Take the stairs.
走樓梯

1447
02:33:20,734 --> 02:33:21,776
Yeah?
幹嘛

1448
02:33:23,988 --> 02:33:28,157
Security. There's a fire on 3. We have to evacuate all the floors.
酒店保安  三樓發生火警  各樓層的人都要疏散

1449
02:33:28,325 --> 02:33:29,951
I can't leave here.
我不能離開

1450
02:33:38,836 --> 02:33:42,255
Why don't we just talk about this a bit, huh, brother?
我們何不先談一下  兄弟

1451
02:33:56,270 --> 02:33:57,312
He's here on 17.
他在十七樓

1452
02:34:00,482 --> 02:34:02,817
Look at me. Look at me.
看著我  看著我

1453
02:34:06,155 --> 02:34:07,322
Look at me.
看著我

1454
02:34:39,229 --> 02:34:43,107
L.A.P.D. Don't move. Put your hands on your head, now.
洛城警方  別動  把手放在頭上

1455
02:35:18,227 --> 02:35:20,561
Switch me to TAC 5.
將我轉到五號頻道

1456
02:35:20,729 --> 02:35:23,064
Casals? JJ?
卡索斯  JJ

1457
02:35:23,983 --> 02:35:25,191
Drucker, JJ?
澤加  JJ

1458
02:35:25,359 --> 02:35:27,902
I'm at the lobby level by the stairwell.
我在大堂接近樓梯井

1459
02:35:28,070 --> 02:35:29,070
What have you got?
出了什麼事

1460
02:35:29,238 --> 02:35:32,407
Teams are moving up the other elevators to the 17th floor elevators.
小組搭乘另一升降機前往十七樓

1461
02:35:32,574 --> 02:35:34,742
All out of commission because of the fire alarm.
因為火警警鐘響起  升降機不能用

1462
02:35:34,910 --> 02:35:38,037
- It's a mess. People everywhere. - Fine. 10-4.
- 這裏一團糟  人山人海  - 好的  知道了

1463
02:36:07,860 --> 02:36:09,444
Let's go, get out of the way.
快走  不要擋道

1464
02:36:09,611 --> 02:36:11,529
Stay out of the way.
不要擋道

1465
02:36:19,455 --> 02:36:22,498
Let's go. Go that way. We gotta go, all right? Go, go.
快走  快離開

1466
02:36:25,627 --> 02:36:27,545
I got it, sir.
讓我來  先生

1467
02:36:29,673 --> 02:36:31,591
Come on, come on.
快走

1468
02:36:37,431 --> 02:36:39,057
Come on, sir.
快走  先生

1469
02:36:43,312 --> 02:36:46,314
- Watch your backs, ladies. - I got it, I got it.
- 小心後面  女士們  - 我搞定了

1470
02:36:48,984 --> 02:36:50,651
Keep moving, ma'am.
繼續走  夫人

1471
02:36:51,487 --> 02:36:52,570
Let's go.
走吧

1472
02:36:55,074 --> 02:36:56,324
Come on, let's go.
快點  走吧

1473
02:37:30,943 --> 02:37:32,610
This way, ma'am.
走這邊  夫人

1474
02:37:34,571 --> 02:37:36,364
Get back, get back.
後退  後退

1475
02:38:02,224 --> 02:38:04,642
- Let me have that shotgun. - Yes, sir.
- 把槍給我  - 是  長官

1476
02:44:22,103 --> 02:44:24,855
Told you I'm never going back.
跟你說過  我不會再回到監獄

1477
02:44:28,193 --> 02:44:29,818
Yeah.
是啊


